### Third-Party Notices & Acknowledgments

PowerBeamer relies on and gratefully acknowledges the following open-source projects:

- **[Slint UI](https://slint.dev/)** (GPLv3 / Royalty-Free Desktop License)
  Copyright (c) SixtyFPS GmbH.
  Slint is a comprehensive, declarative GUI toolkit used to power the responsive user interface and multi-window rendering.

- **[Google PDFium](https://pdfium.googlesource.com/pdfium/)** (Apache-2.0 / BSD-3-Clause)
  Copyright (c) 2014-2026 The PDFium Authors.
  Used for ultra-high-fidelity vector PDF rasterization, text search, and slide rendering.

- **[pdfium-render](https://github.com/ajrcore/pdfium-render)** (MIT / Apache-2.0)
  Copyright (c) 2020-2026 Alex Robinson and contributors.
  Idiomatic Rust bindings for the PDFium library.

- **[image-rs](https://github.com/image-rs/image)** (MIT / Apache-2.0)
  High-performance image encoding and decoding library.

- **[serde](https://serde.rs/) & [serde_json](https://github.com/serde-rs/json)** (MIT / Apache-2.0)
  Serialization framework for non-destructive session storage and update metadata.

- **[LaTeX Beamer Project](https://github.com/josephwright/beamer)** (LPPL / GPL)
  Standard LaTeX presentation class and `pgfpages` dual-screen layout specifications.
